          <Pad Id="5yZRVeoWw2dw6Lh7E6DXQb" Bounds="1230,3167,404,126" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="- creating a class&#xD;&#xA;- switching between record/class&#xD;&#xA;- explaining orange socks for mutable and strategies to resolve&#xD;&#xA;- Dashed link&#xD;&#xA;">
